{"id":2861,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p><br></p><p>11月20日，软件学院成功举办“华彩讲坛”学术活动。本次讲坛特邀东北大学软件学院教授、博导，辽宁省智能科学与智能系统重点实验室副主任，沈阳市边缘计算技术创新中心学科带头人马连博教授，带来主题为“面向边缘智能的神经架构搜索与压缩方法研究”的精彩学术报告。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xM77JbozV2L8CZn0zNsoz9sMzv8oz7aYUNV7LmAVnmGDoz70gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkoSyaoShkUzN8M8nVnz9snRn7L7nRnlM7nmQ7UmM2nlrFUmGaL4-8n7VFUl-DoSb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz78LRGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DB909BA947DEE87D4D0DCECDF6DB3FEE/B00324DA/AB69\" vheight=\"135px\" vwidth=\"247px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xM77JbozV2L8CZn0zNsoz9sMzv8oz7aYUNV7LmAVnmGDoz70gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkoSyaoShkUzN8M8nVnz9snRn7L7nRnlM7nmQ7UmM2nlrFUmGaL4-8n7VFUl-DoSb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz78LRGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUmVJkolLsLlWVM0RfRnRv8nlW2LzGabnmvbU4rRnmUDM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4LYhVL1y4LmliLmfRMz-DMRNanmGbU4NsL4n2nmvsM4fFozTfMln7nmWFLNUDMlUJv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMRGagtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C33E2325520C526490F09C9734FF7770/99A5DDF2/2D65D\" vheight=\"143px\" vwidth=\"257px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xUmVJkolLsLlWVM0RfRnRv8nlW2LzGabnmvbU4rRnmUDM4v0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4LYhVL1y4LmliLmfRMz-DMRNanmGbU4NsL4n2nmvsM4fFozTfMln7nmWFLNUDMlUJv2bjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMRGagtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.png\"></p><p>讲座中，马连博教授结合自身科研工作开展情况，围绕当前边缘智能领域的技术需求，在解析边缘智能技术背景的基础上，探讨了该领域面临的设备计算资源受限、网络资源不足等主要挑战及关键科学问题。从算法方法层面，介绍了高效的神经架构性能预测、搜索及轻量化搜索等研究成果；在实际应用层面，讲解了矿井边缘AI加速、3D异常检测等落地案例，并对边缘智能神经架构搜索平台开发、云边端模型协同训练部署、工业智能内嵌AI加速应用等未来方向做了展望。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xoz-JsUlL8nml4M0N7iMN-DnmQRL4-aaMmAkLlU4nmQfU870gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7okyPnky4LRNaL8VRLmT2o7VVMzAkU8-boz9YUlMkLlnFL7CbnRNbnm6FLlCinRLJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMRGagtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CD81D30903AC29F8AE58BCB9982ACB1D/0F9D99F7/1F5D3\" vheight=\"204px\" vwidth=\"267px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xoz-JsUlL8nml4M0N7iMN-DnmQRL4-aaMmAkLlU4nmQfU870gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7okyPnky4LRNaL8VRLmT2o7VVMzAkU8-boz9YUlMkLlnFL7CbnRNbnm6FLlCinRLJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMRGagtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xM4TJ2nz6RMRCiM08-YozWVMzMRL7WafUmnVL4TfU8L4MlU0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVn1hRMkyaUmVVUz7Znz-ZL8LDUmnfL4M7MRn2MNrfM7QFL7WkMzr2Lz6FLm62U4GJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMRGagtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8EFC40B1EA18E283C6B4A33D44F6EA4F/0BB55F17/27FC0\" vheight=\"204px\" vwidth=\"273px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xM4TJ2nz6RMRCiM08-YozWVMzMRL7WafUmnVL4TfU8L4MlU0gihFp2hmCIa0okhVn1hRMkyaUmVVUz7Znz-ZL8LDUmnfL4M7MRn2MNrfM7QFL7WkMzr2Lz6FLm62U4GJqjfjo4OeosWi_dN0qIbtpYyPLzUsg47PMRGagtA8pUPcc&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次讲座开拓了同学们在边缘智能领域的前沿视角，激发了大家在该领域的研究兴趣，为学术交流提供了良好平台。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://ss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=xM77JbozV2L8CZn0zNsoz9sMzv8oz7aYUNV7LmAVnmGDoz70gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkoSyaoShkUzN8M8nVnz9snRn7L7nRnlM7nmQ7UmM2nlrFUmGaL4-8n7VFUl-DoSb/v2veo4OevjrZ_ShXptQ0g47PMRv0Lz78LRGJqdPnx&oid=1406415804&tid=1147&nid=11400&e=.jpg"}